# Warning-only fixture (#39). A single superseded identity facet (it carries
# gmeow:validUntil) that is NOT suppressed (gmeow:displayable true) — this trips
# the gmeow:SupersededFacetSuppressionShape, which is sh:Warning severity
# (Principle 10: a source may lag the flag). The facet is otherwise well-formed:
# exactly one gmeow:genderValue, a single axis type — so NO Violation fires.
# `run_shacl` must report a WARNING but still pass (result.ok is True).

@prefix ex:    <https://example.org/shapes/> .
@prefix gmeow: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/> .
@prefix xsd:   <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

ex:laggedFacet a gmeow:GenderIdentity ;
    gmeow:facetSubject ex:laggedPerson ;
    gmeow:facetVantage ex:laggedPerson ;
    gmeow:genderValue gmeow:genderMan ;
    gmeow:validUntil "2019-01-01T00:00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    gmeow:displayable true .
